ijwnqh2.webp-w750.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Ftn1-f2.kkmh.com\u002Fimage\u002F170203\u002Fa75qf1v2h.webp-w750.jpg","命理师","弱者顺应命运，强者操控命运。叶继铭从高高在上的跨国企业总裁一下子变成了露宿街头的流浪汉，面对未婚妻和好友的背叛，他面临人生的重大抉择。【独家\u002F已完结 责编：998】",1585357,"1.9万",19103,1283,"https:\u002F\u002Ftn1-f2.kkmh.com\u002Fimage\u002F180509\u002Fxb2lcsy67.webp-w750.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Ftn1-f2.kkmh.com\u002Fimage\u002F170717\u002F1rukmrko1.webp-w750.jpg","星海镖师","靠近妹子一米之内就会尿裤子的唐土根同学，梦想竟是成为宇宙最强星际镖师！这个愿望有点不实际？！为了保护最喜欢的人，凭借自身的超强记忆力和口遁之术，土包子真变身顶级镖师，和他的同伴们上演至情至性的成长故事，一起踏上守护之路。【漫言星空授权连载\u002F每周一更新】","53万",530995,13130,"https:\u002F\u002Ftn1-f2.kkmh.com\u002Fimage\u002F170104\u002Fs3mkjo1ls.webp-w750.jpg","https:\u002F\u002Ftn1-f2.kkmh.com\u002Fimage\u002F190327\u002F38ebuBQaT.webp-w750.jpg","一条狗","人与狗互换，将会发生什么爆笑情节？【授权\u002F完结  责编：喵二】",6948391,148397,"147096","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFnrnJ7iQpC5dslmf0B9JYqj-gKKU-w180","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFryeWGE9o1RIL6XbH93iOfgZiLuA-w180","46","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFp6XWbP4GsyPwKlkpd_d1IGcxOYW-w180","14",14,"2019-02-03 10:35","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFqAzcARdXA9nY5Zi4l-ABfRWRcQ0-w180","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFjAYhyz_t3ldtaT855i4Vasr69z9-w180","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFjjs4x3s3uC72VaX6sUfqyUWT51_-w180","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFkRc39lRmcOqAvdBwg5OipQStUVm-w180","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFjZU7iiKb5u02BnSH39OumL8WEgY-w180","42",42,"https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFkwVsoQIA4vAwduModuyDYCTu-6z-w180","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFlvNBQMk95zkkGYfiT5sb_d9dJn0-w180","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002Fimage\u002F170518\u002FQ3wUHUYu3.webp-w180.w.jpg",50,8,"https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FlmE90XTS84v83sekrPEcf5Vchcs--w180","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFkCjDOKaQaAa6ad71Z9GYStoWfIY-w180","Ldh17",136958717,"https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFoABSYOgf-TaBQ-5TUHrx__QBEHl-w180","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFn9DvIy7uMrYfK6fltE_UPp4octD-w180","https:\u002F\u002Ff2.kkmh.com\u002FFjfqgKS